{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこんばんは\n新内眞衣です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2016/01/26/1955948/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(この時親知らずが痛かったのポーズ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のブログでは\nたくさんのコメントありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1500件以上という\n見たことのない数字には\nたくさんの思いが\n１つ１つしっかり込められていて\n感動しました(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと昔のブログを見てみたんだけど\n２年前の初めての誕生日ブログは\n研究生だったから\n誕生日の日に更新できなかったな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨年のブログはコメント1000件\nいかなかったなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ１つにも成長？というか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんの関心が実感できて\n１人でほっこりしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2016/01/26/1955948/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"通勤時間にコメントが読み切れない\nなんて経験初めてです(°_°)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年は更にいろんなメンバーから\nお祝いメールがきたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"欅坂の尾関ちゃんと長沢ちゃん\nのお祝いブログも見ました(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感謝がたくさん出来た\nお誕生日になりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな幸せな1日だったはずなんですが\n私は今年の誕生日\nOL後に体調を崩して\n寝込んでいました、、、泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなにベットと背中が張り付いた\n誕生日は初めてです。泣\nはあ、ついてない、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木神社のおみくじも凶だったもんな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年は体調を万全にして\n誕生日を迎えたいと思います！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんありがとうございました\n素敵な１年にします♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2016/01/26/1955948/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2016/01/26/1955948/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"犬会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだ犬会してきました〜！\n犬天メンバー＋甚古萌さん，音華花さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に楽しかったです(T_T)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10月にやった舞台の縁で\nこうやって定期的に会える関係を築けたのは\n何よりの財産だなって思います"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも犬会やろうね！\n幹事の若さまいつもありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気を使わずふざけたことから\n真面目なことまで話せるみんなが大好きです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなと会うとたくさんの刺激が\n貰える！パワー凄い！\n私も頑張らなきゃな〜(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1月もあと少しで終わりますが\n頑張りましょう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2016/01/26/1955948/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだ遂に！\n欅ちゃん達に会いました〜〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小林由依ちゃんと写真撮ってもらったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2016/01/26/1955948/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな若くてフレッシュで\nとてもいい子で仲良くなりたいな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2016/01/26/1955948/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また機会あったら\n絡みにいこ〜〜♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもよろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【告知】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は24:00〜bayFMにて\nまいちゃんカフェの放送です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いしますm(_ _)m♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラジオとブログで何か連動企画とか\n出来ないかなあ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんて考えてるけど\n浮かばない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにか良い案がある方も\nふつおたなどもこちらまで\nメッセージ待ってます(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"mytune@bayfm.co.jp"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2016/01/26/1955948/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは！今日はこの辺で"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2016/01/26/1955948/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また書きます♪"}],"source":"archive"}